<view class="page feature-page flash-page"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="社群秒杀"></brand-header><view class="pad"><view class="campaign-header panel"><view class="campaign-header-label"><ui-icon name="flash" size="38"></ui-icon><text>本场结束倒计时</text></view><view class="campaign-countdown">{{countdown}}</view><view class="card-note">示例活动 · 每人每项限购1件</view></view><view class="campaign-offer panel" wx:for="{{offers}}" wx:key="id"><button class="campaign-product-row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="viewProduct"><view class="campaign-photo"><media-placeholder src="{{item.image}}" label="项目图片" fit="aspectFit" blank="{{true}}" kind="product"></media-placeholder></view><view class="campaign-product-copy"><view class="campaign-product-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="card-note">{{item.desc}}</view><view class="campaign-stock">活动名额 {{item.stock}} 份（示例）</view></view><ui-icon name="chevron" size="24"></ui-icon></button><view class="between campaign-offer-footer"><view><view class="campaign-deal-price"><text>¥</text>{{item.displayPrice}}</view><view class="campaign-original">日常示例价 ¥{{item.originalPrice}}</view></view><button class="primary-button campaign-action" bindtap="buy" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{submitting || (expired && !item.purchased)}}">{{item.purchased ? '查看订单' : expired ? '已结束' : '立即抢购'}}</button></view></view><view class="notice">当前活动为本地演示，库存、名额和价格为示例；倒计时结束后不可再生成活动订单。</view></view></view>
